      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je galère à trouver un appart à Illumis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000670061006C00E800720065002000E0002000740072006F007500760065007200200075006E0020006100700070006100720074002000E000200049006C006C0075006D00690073002E002E002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a tellement de beaux quartiers, ici !\nJ’ai vraiment envie de m’installer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’ai beau faire un milliard de visites, y a rien\nà faire, j’arrive pas à trouver l’appart parfait...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourtant, j’ai pas l’impression d’être si exigeant\nque ça... Tout ce que je veux, c’est un logement...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... avec vue sur la fameuse <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Tour Prismatique<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !\nQuel bonheur ce serait d’habiter <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>en face<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... proche d’un cours d’eau ! L’idéal serait\npar exemple <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>sur le Quai du Canal des Saisons<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... avec un accès facile au <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>toit<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> ! Mon Iguolta\nen a besoin pour faire le plein de soleil.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, je veux pas le laisser tout seul là-haut,\ndonc faudrait un toit-terrasse avec des <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>tables<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> et<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndes <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>parasols <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>pour que je puisse me poser avec lui.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et enfin, je voudrais que l’appart soit proche\nd’un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>café <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>et d’un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Centre Pokémon<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>. C’est la base !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pas trop demander, pourtant... Si ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020007000610073002000740072006F0070002000640065006D0061006E006400650072002C00200070006F0075007200740061006E0074002E002E002E0020005300690020003F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, tu veux bien m’aider dans ma recherche\nd’appart ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai du mal à en trouver un dans mes critères,\nmais t’auras peut-être plus de chance que moi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On compte sur toi pour nous aider à trouver\nun bel endroit où vivre, avec Iguolta !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je cherche un appart situé en face de la Tour\nPrismatique, sur le Quai du Canal des Saisons,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navec un toit ayant des tables et des parasols !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh, et il doit être situé près d’un café\net d’un Centre Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 217
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vue sur la Tour Prismatique...\nSitué sur le Quai du Canal des Saisons...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nToit-terrasse avec tables et parasols...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nProche d’un Centre Pokémon et d’un café...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCet endroit remplit toutes les conditions !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 210
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo ! Alors, t’as trouvé un coin prometteur\npour Iguolta et moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0020002100200041006C006F00720073002C00200074201900610073002000740072006F0075007600E900200075006E00200063006F0069006E002000700072006F006D006500740074006500750072000A0070006F007500720020004900670075006F006C007400610020006500740020006D006F00690020003F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouah... !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500610068002E002E002E0020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vue sur la Tour Prismatique... check !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560075006500200073007500720020006C006100200054006F0075007200200050007200690073006D006100740069007100750065002E002E002E00200063006800650063006B0020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Situé le long du Canal des Saisons... check !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690074007500E90020006C00650020006C006F006E0067002000640075002000430061006E0061006C002000640065007300200053006100690073006F006E0073002E002E002E00200063006800650063006B0020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un toit-terrasse avec tables et parasols... check !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200074006F00690074002D00740065007200720061007300730065002000610076006500630020007400610062006C00650073002000650074002000700061007200610073006F006C0073002E002E002E00200063006800650063006B0020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Proche d’un café et d’un Centre Pokémon...\ncheck !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500072006F0063006800650020006420190075006E002000630061006600E90020006500740020006420190075006E002000430065006E00740072006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E000A0063006800650063006B0020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a aucun doute ! C’est lui ! C’est l’appart parfait !\nJe vais parler au proprio de ce pas !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes ! Il a dit qu’on pouvait emménager\ndès maintenant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500730020002100200049006C0020006100200064006900740020007100752019006F006E00200070006F0075007600610069007400200065006D006D00E9006E0061006700650072000A006400E800730020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E00740020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Iguolta est ravi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900670075006F006C007400610020006500730074002000720061007600690020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ta !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, le loyer fait mal... Si je loue cet appart,\nje peux faire une croix sur les sorties resto...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ta !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais rien n’est trop beau pour mon Iguolta !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020007200690065006E0020006E2019006500730074002000740072006F00700020006200650061007500200070006F007500720020006D006F006E0020004900670075006F006C007400610020002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est décidé. Jamais je retrouverai un appart\naussi parfait, donc je vais le prendre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de m’avoir aidé à le trouver !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuant au loyer... Bah, j’aurai qu’à participer\nau Royale Z-A, et je réunirai bien les fonds !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Iguolta est si heureux de pouvoir se prélasser\nau soleil ! Son bonheur vaut tous les sacrifices !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
